<title>USA: GCR says overall book pricing looks good.</title>
<headline>GCR says overall book pricing looks good.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>GCR Holdings Ltd said Monday that although continued softness in the property catastrophe market can be expected in the near term, pricing on it overall book and in the property catastrophe market generally is still very attractive on a historical basis.</p>
<p>The company said that despite losses of $6.8 million from Hurricane Fran in the fourth quarter, its loss experience and loss ratio remain very favorable by industry standards.</p>
</text>
